Package: ukui-globaltheme-common
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Common data and settings for UKUI Global Theme
 This package contains the common data and settings for ukui
 global theme. This package contains the default theme for ukui
 globaltheme, which is to be a flavor of Ubuntu.Theme packs
 serve  to beautify the system.

